  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱君，这里是世界上一座没有二手烟的城市，却也是新夜的泛滥的城市。这里是最好的城市，却也是最坏的城市。今天带你来到地球的另一端。加拿大温哥华，你看满大街的麻辣烫、奶茶店、足疗馆，我真的分不清是在温哥华，还是在温州朱君世界这本大书，今天终于翻到了温哥华这页，你相信吗？你不会英语也能够在温哥华活一辈子，尤其是在大温解放区列志文超过百分之五十五的人口都是华人买东西的。中国人卖东西的还是中国人，要是不看车牌，这跟国内有什么区别？感觉在这里，中国人更像本地人，外国人才是外国人。我还遇到了王祖贤姐姐，她多年前退出娱乐圈，之后在温哥华定居，开了一家艾灸馆。在温哥华寸土寸金的市中心，还有一个中山公园、苏式园林，亭台楼阁，旁边的路就叫苏州巷，这里的中国超市东西比国内还要全。在我身后的斯坦林公园，还有一张纪念张国荣的长椅。但是励志文最大的华人夜市将在二零二六年九月落幕，一个时代结束了美人迟暮去国怀乡。我身后的温哥华是全球最宜居的城市童话之城，但却又是全球房价最贵的城市。这里一面天堂，一面地狱好的方面，在温哥华你根本遇不到二手烟。所有公共场所全面禁烟，也不允许设立室内吸烟室，但是在这里却可以当街吸叶子。加拿大是继乌拉圭之后，全球第二个将叶子合法化的国家，比隔壁的美利坚还要自由。这些新叶子的人赶不走，还得安置保护他们。他不咬人，他膈引人。加拿大是全世界最大的发达国家，面积比中国还要大，但是人口竟然只有我国广东省的三分之一。如此巨大的国家，百分之九十的领土几乎是无人区，他全国就是一个大农村。而加拿大这个词儿本意就是村儿的意思。你甚至在大街上还能看到上世纪的电线杆子还都是木头做的。加拿大的矿产资源相当丰富，石油储量世界前三，森林资源世界前三，数不尽的采矿井采油井，关键人家人口还少，这些资源平分到每个人头上，大约合有七百七十万人民币。加拿大的福利可以说涵盖了从生到死。温哥华坐落在加拿大的西海岸西兵乔治亚海峡北望海岸山脉，早上可以滑雪，下午扬帆出海。看到这样的自然环境，你会突然明白，为什么这里诞生了露露、lemon和某祖鸟这样的运动品牌。这是一座被雪山、海洋和森林覆盖的城市。好山好水，好无聊，有人直接被这句话劝退，有人却觉得徒步骑车、露营周末根本不够用。你看同样一句好山好水，好无聊，有人听见牢笼，有人听见自由，这就是喜物同音。有人喜欢辣椒，是因为辣椒辣，有人不喜欢辣椒，也是因为辣椒辣。而有人喜欢温哥华，是因为这里安静。有人不喜欢温德华，也是因为这里安静。最近如果你在冬天来到温哥华，一到下午四点天暗下了就开始怀疑人生。温哥华的抑率全球非常高，它被称之为雨都，每年超过一百六十一天都在下雨。这里冬季长达五个月的阴雨，让人不得不长时间憋在家里。很多华人之所以来温哥华，就是为了孩子的教育，不卷孩子，他们卷自己。我在温哥华看到很多陪读妈妈的生活并不好过，用一代人的孤独来托取下一代。这些家庭各有兴奋，加拿大是全球受教育程度最高的国家之一，每三个国民中就两个是大学生。但是你能接受吗？这里大多数的大学宿舍竟然是男女混住的。加拿大拥有二十八位诺贝尔奖得主，人工智能、量子、计算、生物医药等等领域，全球领先胰岛素、心脏起搏器、对讲机、篮球都是加拿大人发明。加拿大还连续多年蝉联全球最受欢迎留学国家榜，守百分之九十四的国际学生表示优先选择来加拿大。今天我来参观了温哥华当地非常著名的一家私立学校，他们接受两岁到十八岁全年龄段的孩子。这里孩子呢从小学六年级开始，会在全世界三十个国家之间做交换生。该校要求所有的学生都要学会掌握中文学校的课程，甚至还会教给孩子们遇到熊狼迷路，该怎么办？怎么背包？露营生火，看地图，野外避险，而且做缝纫设计，电锯工具AI智能。等等我有一个朋友家孩子来了温华读小学四年级之前在国内呢因为成绩很差，特别自卑，结果来到温哥华，天天被老师夸奖，你怎么这么优秀，他被夸的都不好意思了，这还是我吗？其实我发现这边老外呢说话经常水分很大。如果他说啊你字儿写的good,就说明字是写的根本不咋地。如果他说啊amazing啊，证明你才刚刚达标，主打一个情绪价值。我看这里的老师也不怎么劝孩子读书，都是劝他们快出去玩，会学累了吗？放松点儿。在我看来，你每天下午三点放学有啥好累？加拿大实行从幼儿园到大学的免费公共教育以及全民免费医疗制度，包括基础、医疗、手术以及住院费用。这种高福利的弊端就是催生了一大批的懒人。你看这几位环卫工半小时减了三根树枝，几片叶子在这棵树下晃来晃去，就这半小时工资比别国普通人一天还要多。那一刻，我都想过去告诉他们，要不这棵树还是交给我吧。温哥华没有多伦多的金融枢纽，锋芒，也没有蒙特利尔的法式浪漫。温哥华人最看重的就是家庭和兴趣爱好。天天老婆孩子热炕头遛娃遛狗，日子过得十分慵懒，安逸，逢节必过，宁可放弃薪水，也要去休假、滑雪、露营和旅行。与他们这种松弛感明显不同的，就是当对华人的勤奋。大湾地区有六十多所，中文学校有超过七千家餐厅，人均餐馆密度全球第一。而温哥华的市长也都是华人。如果你来到温哥华的唐人街，看到这样一栋薄的像纸片一样的建筑，这个背后就是一段华人的伤心史。一百多年前，有一位叫陈才的广东客家人从洗衣店砸工逆袭，成为温哥华华人首富。但是加拿大人当时特别排挤华人，温哥华，市政府强行征走了他的一块地，只留下了一条六英尺宽的狭长地皮。就在所有人都认为他会认输的时候，成台偏偏在这么小的地上盖了一座全世界最小的建筑。一八八一到一八八四年前后，大约有一点五万多名华工，参与了加拿大的太平洋铁路建设的。如果没有华人，就没有温哥华的。今天。这段历史最刺痛的地方是需要他们的时候，他们是劳工铁路合拢之后，他们却被当成不该留下的人。直到二零一八年，温哥华市才为这段历史性的骑士正式道歉。华人就这样在温哥华地区上一代在夹缝里求生下一代开始建商场、学校、媒体和争取选票。而未来当地华人真正的挑战不是只在春节舞龙舞狮的时候被欢迎，也要能够在当地争取在公共政策里发生，让两百万在加拿大的华人被打破偏见，获得真正的认可。酒精。我越来越觉得我们中国人终于可以平视这个世界了。以前很多人会靠嘲笑国外的基础设施落后，比如塞纳河、像臭水沟等等来制造一些优越感。而也有一些人把国外想象的处处完美的天堂。其实这两种极端都是很自卑的表现。这些年，当我去过的地方越多，见的人越多，越来越明白，我没有资格去评判我见过的任何一个人。因为每个人的生长环境不同，三观自然天差地别，做出的选择也不同。每个人都是他所处的环境的闲话，每一座城市也都是历史制度与生活方式共同塑造的结果。你眼中的成就或许是别人发达过之后的从容。而你羡慕的松弛感背后，也可能是有低效率和高成本。所以，诸君认识世界的最好方式，不是隔着屏幕去赞美或者嘲笑，而是你自己走进去，与世界坦然相望。有些感受，只有你自己才能亲身体会。比如当你在北美去点麦当劳，服务员会问你可乐，你要大杯还是中杯？大杯呢？要贵几块钱，结果发现竟然是无限免费续杯的那这个分中杯大杯有什么意义吗？搞不懂他们是不会算账吗？还是懒得算这笔账了？再比如加拿大和美国是我去过的非常浪费的国家。你从来不会见到什么节约用水、节约用电这样的标语，尤其是食物吃不完，他们直接扔，从来没有剩饭剩菜这一说。因为他们的孩子从小去农场参观，看到的都是高度机械化的一个人操作，机器可以管理一万亩地。所以他们的孩子从来不觉得农民是一个多么辛苦的职业，甚至会觉得浪费，反而能促进消费。再比如，当我刚想进厕所，突然发现出来一女的，你也无需紧张，不是我走错了也不是他走错了。这里是全性别厕所，习惯就好。温哥华的自由就是一种各过各的自由。这里有一九八五年开通的sky, train,是世界上最早的全自动无人驾驶快速交通系统。这里也还有世界上唯一一台还在服役的蒸汽钟，很多人以为他是维多利亚时代的古董，其实他一九七七年才建成加拿大没有经历过什么真正的大规模战争，这个国家底色是四平八稳的，平静。我见过了很多加拿大人，说话轻声细语，穿着朴素，不太显摆，日常相处，有一种平和克制，甚至与世无争的感觉。在一九三九年，德国的客轮圣路易斯号抵达加拿大港口，船上载着九百多名，主要为犹太人的乘客逃离纳粹的迫害，而加拿大人拒绝了这些犹太难民的安全。避护后来到了二零一八年，加纳人全国开始为当时这段历史正式道歉。他们反思自己的祖父辈们的选择，当求救的人来到门口，你们为什么没有伸手周勋，你只有来过加拿大体验一段时间，你才会明白，为什么这片土地会孕育出白求恩这种伟大的人道主义的善良酒精。如果你不小心生活在这样一种资源充足、节奏缓慢、竞争不激烈的环境中，你会变成什么样的人？环境会影响，但不会决定温哥华不是答案，它是一道关于人生排序的选择题、工作和家庭挣钱和生活。你把什么放在前面当自由，也包括那些你不喜欢的人的时候，你还愿不愿意尊重他？旅行利益从来不是给不同的国家去打分，而是让我们重新校准自己看世界的尺度。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00001",
      "start_ms": 350,
      "end_ms": 750,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1150,
      "end_ms": 3730,
      "text": "这里是世界上一座没有二手烟的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3890,
      "end_ms": 6010,
      "text": "却也是新夜的泛滥的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6370,
      "end_ms": 7690,
      "text": "这里是最好的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7950,
      "end_ms": 9350,
      "text": "却也是最坏的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9830,
      "end_ms": 11690,
      "text": "今天带你来到地球的另一端。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11830,
      "end_ms": 13190,
      "text": "加拿大温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13450,
      "end_ms": 16650,
      "text": "你看满大街的麻辣烫、奶茶店、足疗馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16850,
      "end_ms": 18510,
      "text": "我真的分不清是在温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18610,
      "end_ms": 21870,
      "text": "还是在温州朱君世界这本大书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21890,
      "end_ms": 24070,
      "text": "今天终于翻到了温哥华这页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24410,
      "end_ms": 25150,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25270,
      "end_ms": 28210,
      "text": "你不会英语也能够在温哥华活一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28450,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "尤其是在大温解放区列志文超过百分之五十五的人口都是华人买东西的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35020,
      "end_ms": 37220,
      "text": "中国人卖东西的还是中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37760,
      "end_ms": 38720,
      "text": "要是不看车牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38780,
      "end_ms": 40140,
      "text": "这跟国内有什么区别？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40600,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "感觉在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41360,
      "end_ms": 42840,
      "text": "中国人更像本地人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00020",
      "start_ms": 42840,
      "end_ms": 44340,
      "text": "外国人才是外国人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44840,
      "end_ms": 46480,
      "text": "我还遇到了王祖贤姐姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46620,
      "end_ms": 48120,
      "text": "她多年前退出娱乐圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00023",
      "start_ms": 48120,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "text": "之后在温哥华定居，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00024",
      "start_ms": 49560,
      "end_ms": 50620,
      "text": "开了一家艾灸馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00025",
      "start_ms": 50860,
      "end_ms": 52760,
      "text": "在温哥华寸土寸金的市中心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00026",
      "start_ms": 52800,
      "end_ms": 55580,
      "text": "还有一个中山公园、苏式园林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00027",
      "start_ms": 55660,
      "end_ms": 56600,
      "text": "亭台楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00028",
      "start_ms": 56700,
      "end_ms": 58520,
      "text": "旁边的路就叫苏州巷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00029",
      "start_ms": 58840,
      "end_ms": 61555,
      "text": "这里的中国超市东西比国内还要全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00030",
      "start_ms": 61820,
      "end_ms": 63220,
      "text": "在我身后的斯坦林公园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00031",
      "start_ms": 63220,
      "end_ms": 65365,
      "text": "还有一张纪念张国荣的长椅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00032",
      "start_ms": 66050,
      "end_ms": 69810,
      "text": "但是励志文最大的华人夜市将在二零二六年九月落幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00033",
      "start_ms": 69830,
      "end_ms": 73705,
      "text": "一个时代结束了美人迟暮去国怀乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00034",
      "start_ms": 74200,
      "end_ms": 77645,
      "text": "我身后的温哥华是全球最宜居的城市童话之城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00035",
      "start_ms": 77960,
      "end_ms": 80285,
      "text": "但却又是全球房价最贵的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00036",
      "start_ms": 80630,
      "end_ms": 81650,
      "text": "这里一面天堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00037",
      "start_ms": 81730,
      "end_ms": 83600,
      "text": "一面地狱好的方面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00038",
      "start_ms": 83680,
      "end_ms": 85515,
      "text": "在温哥华你根本遇不到二手烟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00039",
      "start_ms": 85850,
      "end_ms": 87810,
      "text": "所有公共场所全面禁烟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00040",
      "start_ms": 87810,
      "end_ms": 89635,
      "text": "也不允许设立室内吸烟室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00041",
      "start_ms": 90050,
      "end_ms": 92225,
      "text": "但是在这里却可以当街吸叶子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00042",
      "start_ms": 92820,
      "end_ms": 94460,
      "text": "加拿大是继乌拉圭之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00043",
      "start_ms": 94460,
      "end_ms": 96940,
      "text": "全球第二个将叶子合法化的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00044",
      "start_ms": 96960,
      "end_ms": 98745,
      "text": "比隔壁的美利坚还要自由。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00045",
      "start_ms": 99180,
      "end_ms": 100780,
      "text": "这些新叶子的人赶不走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00046",
      "start_ms": 100800,
      "end_ms": 102195,
      "text": "还得安置保护他们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00047",
      "start_ms": 102450,
      "end_ms": 103150,
      "text": "他不咬人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00048",
      "start_ms": 103210,
      "end_ms": 103825,
      "text": "他膈引人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00049",
      "start_ms": 104310,
      "end_ms": 106890,
      "text": "加拿大是全世界最大的发达国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00050",
      "start_ms": 106930,
      "end_ms": 108310,
      "text": "面积比中国还要大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00051",
      "start_ms": 108410,
      "end_ms": 111285,
      "text": "但是人口竟然只有我国广东省的三分之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00052",
      "start_ms": 111800,
      "end_ms": 113120,
      "text": "如此巨大的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00053",
      "start_ms": 113160,
      "end_ms": 115595,
      "text": "百分之九十的领土几乎是无人区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00054",
      "start_ms": 115840,
      "end_ms": 117605,
      "text": "他全国就是一个大农村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00055",
      "start_ms": 118040,
      "end_ms": 121085,
      "text": "而加拿大这个词儿本意就是村儿的意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00056",
      "start_ms": 121490,
      "end_ms": 125525,
      "text": "你甚至在大街上还能看到上世纪的电线杆子还都是木头做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00057",
      "start_ms": 125760,
      "end_ms": 127775,
      "text": "加拿大的矿产资源相当丰富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00058",
      "start_ms": 128050,
      "end_ms": 129610,
      "text": "石油储量世界前三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00059",
      "start_ms": 129750,
      "end_ms": 131210,
      "text": "森林资源世界前三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00060",
      "start_ms": 131390,
      "end_ms": 133375,
      "text": "数不尽的采矿井采油井，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00061",
      "start_ms": 133680,
      "end_ms": 134915,
      "text": "关键人家人口还少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00062",
      "start_ms": 135270,
      "end_ms": 137310,
      "text": "这些资源平分到每个人头上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00063",
      "start_ms": 137390,
      "end_ms": 139365,
      "text": "大约合有七百七十万人民币。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00064",
      "start_ms": 139760,
      "end_ms": 142565,
      "text": "加拿大的福利可以说涵盖了从生到死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00065",
      "start_ms": 143070,
      "end_ms": 147925,
      "text": "温哥华坐落在加拿大的西海岸西兵乔治亚海峡北望海岸山脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00066",
      "start_ms": 148260,
      "end_ms": 149240,
      "text": "早上可以滑雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00067",
      "start_ms": 149280,
      "end_ms": 150485,
      "text": "下午扬帆出海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00068",
      "start_ms": 150810,
      "end_ms": 151910,
      "text": "看到这样的自然环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00069",
      "start_ms": 151910,
      "end_ms": 152670,
      "text": "你会突然明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00070",
      "start_ms": 152670,
      "end_ms": 156225,
      "text": "为什么这里诞生了露露、lemon和某祖鸟这样的运动品牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00071",
      "start_ms": 156550,
      "end_ms": 159855,
      "text": "这是一座被雪山、海洋和森林覆盖的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00072",
      "start_ms": 160210,
      "end_ms": 161410,
      "text": "好山好水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00073",
      "start_ms": 161490,
      "end_ms": 162145,
      "text": "好无聊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00074",
      "start_ms": 162560,
      "end_ms": 164125,
      "text": "有人直接被这句话劝退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00075",
      "start_ms": 164420,
      "end_ms": 167855,
      "text": "有人却觉得徒步骑车、露营周末根本不够用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00076",
      "start_ms": 168260,
      "end_ms": 170270,
      "text": "你看同样一句好山好水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00077",
      "start_ms": 170270,
      "end_ms": 170750,
      "text": "好无聊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00078",
      "start_ms": 170970,
      "end_ms": 172170,
      "text": "有人听见牢笼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00079",
      "start_ms": 172350,
      "end_ms": 173465,
      "text": "有人听见自由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00080",
      "start_ms": 173800,
      "end_ms": 175375,
      "text": "这就是喜物同音。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00081",
      "start_ms": 175900,
      "end_ms": 176860,
      "text": "有人喜欢辣椒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00082",
      "start_ms": 176860,
      "end_ms": 177705,
      "text": "是因为辣椒辣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00083",
      "start_ms": 177960,
      "end_ms": 178980,
      "text": "有人不喜欢辣椒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00084",
      "start_ms": 178980,
      "end_ms": 180045,
      "text": "也是因为辣椒辣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00085",
      "start_ms": 180260,
      "end_ms": 181460,
      "text": "而有人喜欢温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00086",
      "start_ms": 181460,
      "end_ms": 182425,
      "text": "是因为这里安静。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00087",
      "start_ms": 182780,
      "end_ms": 184060,
      "text": "有人不喜欢温德华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00088",
      "start_ms": 184060,
      "end_ms": 185095,
      "text": "也是因为这里安静。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00089",
      "start_ms": 185520,
      "end_ms": 187900,
      "text": "最近如果你在冬天来到温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00090",
      "start_ms": 187980,
      "end_ms": 191075,
      "text": "一到下午四点天暗下了就开始怀疑人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00091",
      "start_ms": 191500,
      "end_ms": 193645,
      "text": "温哥华的抑率全球非常高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00092",
      "start_ms": 193930,
      "end_ms": 195150,
      "text": "它被称之为雨都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00093",
      "start_ms": 195430,
      "end_ms": 197715,
      "text": "每年超过一百六十一天都在下雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00094",
      "start_ms": 198180,
      "end_ms": 200180,
      "text": "这里冬季长达五个月的阴雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00095",
      "start_ms": 200180,
      "end_ms": 202155,
      "text": "让人不得不长时间憋在家里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00096",
      "start_ms": 202450,
      "end_ms": 203930,
      "text": "很多华人之所以来温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00097",
      "start_ms": 203990,
      "end_ms": 205315,
      "text": "就是为了孩子的教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00098",
      "start_ms": 205550,
      "end_ms": 206350,
      "text": "不卷孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00099",
      "start_ms": 206390,
      "end_ms": 207235,
      "text": "他们卷自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00100",
      "start_ms": 207720,
      "end_ms": 210855,
      "text": "我在温哥华看到很多陪读妈妈的生活并不好过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00101",
      "start_ms": 211250,
      "end_ms": 213435,
      "text": "用一代人的孤独来托取下一代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00102",
      "start_ms": 213650,
      "end_ms": 215155,
      "text": "这些家庭各有兴奋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00103",
      "start_ms": 215810,
      "end_ms": 218510,
      "text": "加拿大是全球受教育程度最高的国家之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00104",
      "start_ms": 218530,
      "end_ms": 220835,
      "text": "每三个国民中就两个是大学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00105",
      "start_ms": 221130,
      "end_ms": 222130,
      "text": "但是你能接受吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00106",
      "start_ms": 222190,
      "end_ms": 225275,
      "text": "这里大多数的大学宿舍竟然是男女混住的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00107",
      "start_ms": 225860,
      "end_ms": 228060,
      "text": "加拿大拥有二十八位诺贝尔奖得主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00108",
      "start_ms": 228140,
      "end_ms": 230760,
      "text": "人工智能、量子、计算、生物医药等等领域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00109",
      "start_ms": 230760,
      "end_ms": 235765,
      "text": "全球领先胰岛素、心脏起搏器、对讲机、篮球都是加拿大人发明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00110",
      "start_ms": 236390,
      "end_ms": 240610,
      "text": "加拿大还连续多年蝉联全球最受欢迎留学国家榜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00111",
      "start_ms": 240610,
      "end_ms": 244715,
      "text": "守百分之九十四的国际学生表示优先选择来加拿大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00112",
      "start_ms": 245160,
      "end_ms": 248360,
      "text": "今天我来参观了温哥华当地非常著名的一家私立学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00113",
      "start_ms": 248500,
      "end_ms": 251665,
      "text": "他们接受两岁到十八岁全年龄段的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00114",
      "start_ms": 252020,
      "end_ms": 253940,
      "text": "这里孩子呢从小学六年级开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00115",
      "start_ms": 253940,
      "end_ms": 256985,
      "text": "会在全世界三十个国家之间做交换生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00116",
      "start_ms": 257290,
      "end_ms": 261000,
      "text": "该校要求所有的学生都要学会掌握中文学校的课程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00117",
      "start_ms": 261000,
      "end_ms": 264420,
      "text": "甚至还会教给孩子们遇到熊狼迷路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00118",
      "start_ms": 264420,
      "end_ms": 265115,
      "text": "该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00119",
      "start_ms": 265600,
      "end_ms": 266160,
      "text": "怎么背包？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00120",
      "start_ms": 266160,
      "end_ms": 267160,
      "text": "露营生火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00121",
      "start_ms": 267240,
      "end_ms": 267860,
      "text": "看地图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00122",
      "start_ms": 267880,
      "end_ms": 268640,
      "text": "野外避险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00123",
      "start_ms": 268800,
      "end_ms": 270140,
      "text": "而且做缝纫设计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00124",
      "start_ms": 270140,
      "end_ms": 271680,
      "text": "电锯工具AI智能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00125",
      "start_ms": 271680,
      "end_ms": 277360,
      "text": "等等我有一个朋友家孩子来了温华读小学四年级之前在国内呢因为成绩很差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00126",
      "start_ms": 277460,
      "end_ms": 278175,
      "text": "特别自卑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00127",
      "start_ms": 278460,
      "end_ms": 279460,
      "text": "结果来到温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00128",
      "start_ms": 279460,
      "end_ms": 280715,
      "text": "天天被老师夸奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00129",
      "start_ms": 280950,
      "end_ms": 281945,
      "text": "你怎么这么优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00130",
      "start_ms": 282130,
      "end_ms": 283230,
      "text": "他被夸的都不好意思了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00131",
      "start_ms": 283230,
      "end_ms": 283935,
      "text": "这还是我吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00132",
      "start_ms": 284610,
      "end_ms": 287645,
      "text": "其实我发现这边老外呢说话经常水分很大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00133",
      "start_ms": 288030,
      "end_ms": 289935,
      "text": "如果他说啊你字儿写的good,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00134",
      "start_ms": 290390,
      "end_ms": 291835,
      "text": "就说明字是写的根本不咋地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00135",
      "start_ms": 292290,
      "end_ms": 294050,
      "text": "如果他说啊amazing啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00136",
      "start_ms": 294050,
      "end_ms": 295390,
      "text": "证明你才刚刚达标，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00137",
      "start_ms": 295970,
      "end_ms": 297290,
      "text": "主打一个情绪价值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00138",
      "start_ms": 297850,
      "end_ms": 300289,
      "text": "我看这里的老师也不怎么劝孩子读书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00139",
      "start_ms": 300370,
      "end_ms": 301890,
      "text": "都是劝他们快出去玩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00140",
      "start_ms": 301890,
      "end_ms": 302950,
      "text": "会学累了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00141",
      "start_ms": 303050,
      "end_ms": 303910,
      "text": "放松点儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00142",
      "start_ms": 304050,
      "end_ms": 304610,
      "text": "在我看来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00143",
      "start_ms": 304610,
      "end_ms": 306710,
      "text": "你每天下午三点放学有啥好累？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00144",
      "start_ms": 307050,
      "end_ms": 312370,
      "text": "加拿大实行从幼儿园到大学的免费公共教育以及全民免费医疗制度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00145",
      "start_ms": 312530,
      "end_ms": 314770,
      "text": "包括基础、医疗、手术以及住院费用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00146",
      "start_ms": 315050,
      "end_ms": 318590,
      "text": "这种高福利的弊端就是催生了一大批的懒人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00147",
      "start_ms": 319010,
      "end_ms": 322100,
      "text": "你看这几位环卫工半小时减了三根树枝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00148",
      "start_ms": 322300,
      "end_ms": 324960,
      "text": "几片叶子在这棵树下晃来晃去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00149",
      "start_ms": 325180,
      "end_ms": 328320,
      "text": "就这半小时工资比别国普通人一天还要多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00150",
      "start_ms": 328460,
      "end_ms": 328800,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00151",
      "start_ms": 328800,
      "end_ms": 330020,
      "text": "我都想过去告诉他们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00152",
      "start_ms": 330020,
      "end_ms": 331620,
      "text": "要不这棵树还是交给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00153",
      "start_ms": 332020,
      "end_ms": 334140,
      "text": "温哥华没有多伦多的金融枢纽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00154",
      "start_ms": 334140,
      "end_ms": 334540,
      "text": "锋芒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00155",
      "start_ms": 334600,
      "end_ms": 336340,
      "text": "也没有蒙特利尔的法式浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00156",
      "start_ms": 336620,
      "end_ms": 339380,
      "text": "温哥华人最看重的就是家庭和兴趣爱好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00157",
      "start_ms": 339500,
      "end_ms": 342500,
      "text": "天天老婆孩子热炕头遛娃遛狗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00158",
      "start_ms": 342660,
      "end_ms": 344060,
      "text": "日子过得十分慵懒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00159",
      "start_ms": 344080,
      "end_ms": 344480,
      "text": "安逸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00160",
      "start_ms": 344540,
      "end_ms": 345480,
      "text": "逢节必过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00161",
      "start_ms": 345780,
      "end_ms": 346800,
      "text": "宁可放弃薪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00162",
      "start_ms": 346800,
      "end_ms": 349500,
      "text": "也要去休假、滑雪、露营和旅行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00163",
      "start_ms": 349780,
      "end_ms": 351600,
      "text": "与他们这种松弛感明显不同的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00164",
      "start_ms": 351600,
      "end_ms": 353165,
      "text": "就是当对华人的勤奋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00165",
      "start_ms": 353680,
      "end_ms": 355140,
      "text": "大湾地区有六十多所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00166",
      "start_ms": 355140,
      "end_ms": 357505,
      "text": "中文学校有超过七千家餐厅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00167",
      "start_ms": 357780,
      "end_ms": 359715,
      "text": "人均餐馆密度全球第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00168",
      "start_ms": 360020,
      "end_ms": 362075,
      "text": "而温哥华的市长也都是华人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00169",
      "start_ms": 362570,
      "end_ms": 364210,
      "text": "如果你来到温哥华的唐人街，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00170",
      "start_ms": 364250,
      "end_ms": 366685,
      "text": "看到这样一栋薄的像纸片一样的建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00171",
      "start_ms": 366960,
      "end_ms": 369315,
      "text": "这个背后就是一段华人的伤心史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00172",
      "start_ms": 369840,
      "end_ms": 370600,
      "text": "一百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00173",
      "start_ms": 370600,
      "end_ms": 374780,
      "text": "有一位叫陈才的广东客家人从洗衣店砸工逆袭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00174",
      "start_ms": 374780,
      "end_ms": 376385,
      "text": "成为温哥华华人首富。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00175",
      "start_ms": 376820,
      "end_ms": 379265,
      "text": "但是加拿大人当时特别排挤华人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00176",
      "start_ms": 379560,
      "end_ms": 380000,
      "text": "温哥华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00177",
      "start_ms": 380000,
      "end_ms": 382045,
      "text": "市政府强行征走了他的一块地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00178",
      "start_ms": 382410,
      "end_ms": 385175,
      "text": "只留下了一条六英尺宽的狭长地皮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00179",
      "start_ms": 385800,
      "end_ms": 388085,
      "text": "就在所有人都认为他会认输的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00180",
      "start_ms": 388380,
      "end_ms": 392065,
      "text": "成台偏偏在这么小的地上盖了一座全世界最小的建筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00181",
      "start_ms": 392460,
      "end_ms": 394620,
      "text": "一八八一到一八八四年前后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00182",
      "start_ms": 394720,
      "end_ms": 396620,
      "text": "大约有一点五万多名华工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00183",
      "start_ms": 396620,
      "end_ms": 398625,
      "text": "参与了加拿大的太平洋铁路建设的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00184",
      "start_ms": 398960,
      "end_ms": 399880,
      "text": "如果没有华人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00185",
      "start_ms": 399880,
      "end_ms": 400840,
      "text": "就没有温哥华的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00186",
      "start_ms": 400840,
      "end_ms": 401285,
      "text": "今天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00187",
      "start_ms": 401650,
      "end_ms": 404590,
      "text": "这段历史最刺痛的地方是需要他们的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00188",
      "start_ms": 404590,
      "end_ms": 406930,
      "text": "他们是劳工铁路合拢之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00189",
      "start_ms": 406930,
      "end_ms": 408805,
      "text": "他们却被当成不该留下的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00190",
      "start_ms": 409170,
      "end_ms": 410010,
      "text": "直到二零一八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00191",
      "start_ms": 410010,
      "end_ms": 413085,
      "text": "温哥华市才为这段历史性的骑士正式道歉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00192",
      "start_ms": 413600,
      "end_ms": 420245,
      "text": "华人就这样在温哥华地区上一代在夹缝里求生下一代开始建商场、学校、媒体和争取选票。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00193",
      "start_ms": 420610,
      "end_ms": 425485,
      "text": "而未来当地华人真正的挑战不是只在春节舞龙舞狮的时候被欢迎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00194",
      "start_ms": 425750,
      "end_ms": 428605,
      "text": "也要能够在当地争取在公共政策里发生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00195",
      "start_ms": 428900,
      "end_ms": 431905,
      "text": "让两百万在加拿大的华人被打破偏见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00196",
      "start_ms": 432150,
      "end_ms": 433145,
      "text": "获得真正的认可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00197",
      "start_ms": 433720,
      "end_ms": 434215,
      "text": "酒精。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00198",
      "start_ms": 434530,
      "end_ms": 437685,
      "text": "我越来越觉得我们中国人终于可以平视这个世界了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00199",
      "start_ms": 438020,
      "end_ms": 441035,
      "text": "以前很多人会靠嘲笑国外的基础设施落后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00200",
      "start_ms": 441260,
      "end_ms": 444255,
      "text": "比如塞纳河、像臭水沟等等来制造一些优越感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00201",
      "start_ms": 444540,
      "end_ms": 447635,
      "text": "而也有一些人把国外想象的处处完美的天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00202",
      "start_ms": 448080,
      "end_ms": 450695,
      "text": "其实这两种极端都是很自卑的表现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00203",
      "start_ms": 451050,
      "end_ms": 451470,
      "text": "这些年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00204",
      "start_ms": 451470,
      "end_ms": 452750,
      "text": "当我去过的地方越多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00205",
      "start_ms": 452790,
      "end_ms": 453630,
      "text": "见的人越多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00206",
      "start_ms": 453730,
      "end_ms": 454565,
      "text": "越来越明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00207",
      "start_ms": 454850,
      "end_ms": 457555,
      "text": "我没有资格去评判我见过的任何一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00208",
      "start_ms": 457860,
      "end_ms": 459575,
      "text": "因为每个人的生长环境不同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00209",
      "start_ms": 459860,
      "end_ms": 461385,
      "text": "三观自然天差地别，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00210",
      "start_ms": 461640,
      "end_ms": 462745,
      "text": "做出的选择也不同。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00211",
      "start_ms": 463110,
      "end_ms": 465355,
      "text": "每个人都是他所处的环境的闲话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00212",
      "start_ms": 465790,
      "end_ms": 470065,
      "text": "每一座城市也都是历史制度与生活方式共同塑造的结果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00213",
      "start_ms": 470470,
      "end_ms": 473735,
      "text": "你眼中的成就或许是别人发达过之后的从容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00214",
      "start_ms": 473990,
      "end_ms": 475655,
      "text": "而你羡慕的松弛感背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00215",
      "start_ms": 475840,
      "end_ms": 477755,
      "text": "也可能是有低效率和高成本。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00216",
      "start_ms": 478140,
      "end_ms": 478360,
      "text": "所以，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00217",
      "start_ms": 478360,
      "end_ms": 480565,
      "text": "诸君认识世界的最好方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00218",
      "start_ms": 480830,
      "end_ms": 483085,
      "text": "不是隔着屏幕去赞美或者嘲笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00219",
      "start_ms": 483310,
      "end_ms": 484930,
      "text": "而是你自己走进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00220",
      "start_ms": 485050,
      "end_ms": 486695,
      "text": "与世界坦然相望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00221",
      "start_ms": 487080,
      "end_ms": 487780,
      "text": "有些感受，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00222",
      "start_ms": 487780,
      "end_ms": 489455,
      "text": "只有你自己才能亲身体会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00223",
      "start_ms": 489690,
      "end_ms": 491705,
      "text": "比如当你在北美去点麦当劳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00224",
      "start_ms": 492050,
      "end_ms": 493270,
      "text": "服务员会问你可乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00225",
      "start_ms": 493270,
      "end_ms": 494555,
      "text": "你要大杯还是中杯？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00226",
      "start_ms": 494900,
      "end_ms": 495300,
      "text": "大杯呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00227",
      "start_ms": 495300,
      "end_ms": 496135,
      "text": "要贵几块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00228",
      "start_ms": 496360,
      "end_ms": 501420,
      "text": "结果发现竟然是无限免费续杯的那这个分中杯大杯有什么意义吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00229",
      "start_ms": 501560,
      "end_ms": 503220,
      "text": "搞不懂他们是不会算账吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00230",
      "start_ms": 503220,
      "end_ms": 504685,
      "text": "还是懒得算这笔账了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00231",
      "start_ms": 505120,
      "end_ms": 507985,
      "text": "再比如加拿大和美国是我去过的非常浪费的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00232",
      "start_ms": 508310,
      "end_ms": 512035,
      "text": "你从来不会见到什么节约用水、节约用电这样的标语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00233",
      "start_ms": 512400,
      "end_ms": 513760,
      "text": "尤其是食物吃不完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00234",
      "start_ms": 513760,
      "end_ms": 514545,
      "text": "他们直接扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00235",
      "start_ms": 514790,
      "end_ms": 516565,
      "text": "从来没有剩饭剩菜这一说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00236",
      "start_ms": 517010,
      "end_ms": 518990,
      "text": "因为他们的孩子从小去农场参观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00237",
      "start_ms": 519030,
      "end_ms": 521890,
      "text": "看到的都是高度机械化的一个人操作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00238",
      "start_ms": 521910,
      "end_ms": 523405,
      "text": "机器可以管理一万亩地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00239",
      "start_ms": 523730,
      "end_ms": 526675,
      "text": "所以他们的孩子从来不觉得农民是一个多么辛苦的职业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00240",
      "start_ms": 527180,
      "end_ms": 528540,
      "text": "甚至会觉得浪费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00241",
      "start_ms": 528540,
      "end_ms": 529725,
      "text": "反而能促进消费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00242",
      "start_ms": 530130,
      "end_ms": 530570,
      "text": "再比如，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00243",
      "start_ms": 530570,
      "end_ms": 531690,
      "text": "当我刚想进厕所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00244",
      "start_ms": 531690,
      "end_ms": 533175,
      "text": "突然发现出来一女的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00245",
      "start_ms": 533400,
      "end_ms": 534340,
      "text": "你也无需紧张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00246",
      "start_ms": 534420,
      "end_ms": 536380,
      "text": "不是我走错了也不是他走错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00247",
      "start_ms": 536380,
      "end_ms": 537880,
      "text": "这里是全性别厕所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00248",
      "start_ms": 538000,
      "end_ms": 538775,
      "text": "习惯就好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00249",
      "start_ms": 539250,
      "end_ms": 542155,
      "text": "温哥华的自由就是一种各过各的自由。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00250",
      "start_ms": 542660,
      "end_ms": 544520,
      "text": "这里有一九八五年开通的sky,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00251",
      "start_ms": 544520,
      "end_ms": 544800,
      "text": " train,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00252",
      "start_ms": 544800,
      "end_ms": 548235,
      "text": "是世界上最早的全自动无人驾驶快速交通系统。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00253",
      "start_ms": 548590,
      "end_ms": 551745,
      "text": "这里也还有世界上唯一一台还在服役的蒸汽钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00254",
      "start_ms": 552170,
      "end_ms": 554370,
      "text": "很多人以为他是维多利亚时代的古董，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00255",
      "start_ms": 554490,
      "end_ms": 559975,
      "text": "其实他一九七七年才建成加拿大没有经历过什么真正的大规模战争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00256",
      "start_ms": 560240,
      "end_ms": 562160,
      "text": "这个国家底色是四平八稳的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00257",
      "start_ms": 562160,
      "end_ms": 562675,
      "text": "平静。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00258",
      "start_ms": 562990,
      "end_ms": 564290,
      "text": "我见过了很多加拿大人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00259",
      "start_ms": 564290,
      "end_ms": 565430,
      "text": "说话轻声细语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00260",
      "start_ms": 565430,
      "end_ms": 566210,
      "text": "穿着朴素，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00261",
      "start_ms": 566370,
      "end_ms": 567315,
      "text": "不太显摆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00262",
      "start_ms": 567620,
      "end_ms": 568240,
      "text": "日常相处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00263",
      "start_ms": 568240,
      "end_ms": 569845,
      "text": "有一种平和克制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00264",
      "start_ms": 570070,
      "end_ms": 571485,
      "text": "甚至与世无争的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00265",
      "start_ms": 571990,
      "end_ms": 572950,
      "text": "在一九三九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00266",
      "start_ms": 572950,
      "end_ms": 575815,
      "text": "德国的客轮圣路易斯号抵达加拿大港口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00267",
      "start_ms": 576190,
      "end_ms": 577890,
      "text": "船上载着九百多名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00268",
      "start_ms": 577890,
      "end_ms": 580615,
      "text": "主要为犹太人的乘客逃离纳粹的迫害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00269",
      "start_ms": 580860,
      "end_ms": 583500,
      "text": "而加拿大人拒绝了这些犹太难民的安全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00270",
      "start_ms": 583500,
      "end_ms": 585435,
      "text": "避护后来到了二零一八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00271",
      "start_ms": 585700,
      "end_ms": 588955,
      "text": "加纳人全国开始为当时这段历史正式道歉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00272",
      "start_ms": 589320,
      "end_ms": 591515,
      "text": "他们反思自己的祖父辈们的选择，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00273",
      "start_ms": 591820,
      "end_ms": 593385,
      "text": "当求救的人来到门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00274",
      "start_ms": 593640,
      "end_ms": 595870,
      "text": "你们为什么没有伸手周勋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00275",
      "start_ms": 596090,
      "end_ms": 598130,
      "text": "你只有来过加拿大体验一段时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00276",
      "start_ms": 598130,
      "end_ms": 598910,
      "text": "你才会明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00277",
      "start_ms": 598910,
      "end_ms": 604535,
      "text": "为什么这片土地会孕育出白求恩这种伟大的人道主义的善良酒精。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00278",
      "start_ms": 604740,
      "end_ms": 610300,
      "text": "如果你不小心生活在这样一种资源充足、节奏缓慢、竞争不激烈的环境中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00279",
      "start_ms": 610520,
      "end_ms": 611835,
      "text": "你会变成什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00280",
      "start_ms": 612350,
      "end_ms": 613295,
      "text": "环境会影响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00281",
      "start_ms": 613650,
      "end_ms": 616245,
      "text": "但不会决定温哥华不是答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00282",
      "start_ms": 616520,
      "end_ms": 621330,
      "text": "它是一道关于人生排序的选择题、工作和家庭挣钱和生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00283",
      "start_ms": 621470,
      "end_ms": 623640,
      "text": "你把什么放在前面当自由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00284",
      "start_ms": 623700,
      "end_ms": 625760,
      "text": "也包括那些你不喜欢的人的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00285",
      "start_ms": 625900,
      "end_ms": 627175,
      "text": "你还愿不愿意尊重他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00286",
      "start_ms": 627740,
      "end_ms": 630280,
      "text": "旅行利益从来不是给不同的国家去打分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1585b3e630e4669a_s00287",
      "start_ms": 630520,
      "end_ms": 633715,
      "text": "而是让我们重新校准自己看世界的尺度。"
    }
  ],
